This file contains the initial defaults for Gecko command configuration.

Values set by 'gecko env -w' and written to the user's gecko/env file

override these defaults.

Environment variables override everything else.

Use the Go module mirror and checksum database by default.

Gecko remains compatible with the Go module ecosystem.

See https://proxy.golang.org for details.

GKPROXY=https://proxy.golang.org,direct
GKSUMDB=sum.golang.org

Automatically select or download a newer Gecko-compatible toolchain

when requested by the project's configuration.

GKTOOLCHAIN=auto
